      "content": "maybe that's the point though. maybe some things just can't be fixed or healed. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i just wasn't a factor anymore. not out of anger, just because it feels like the only way to stop being this... this mistake. does it even make sense to keep trying to \"heal\" something that's just fundamentally rotten?",
